  "description": "The Teammachine 01 AMP THREE is BMC performance and ride DNA, amplified for more distance, more climbing, but with the same instincts. Its uncompromising 01 Premium Carbon layup keeps power transfer razor-sharp and weight minimal, while the TQ-HPR40 motor system adds 200 watts of smooth, natural-feeling pedal assist – support that feels like good legs on a very good day.\nGeometry and balance excel as road-first, while our Tuned Compliance Concept Race smooths broken tarmac and long efforts. Integration is clean and minimal, with a discreet OLED control unit to manage your power with next-level connectivity.\nCompleted with a dependable Shimano 105 Di2 drivetrain for durable shifting and braking, BMC ICS 2 stem and HB D4 alloy bars to give a clean, adjustable cockpit, and AR 27 wheelset for the core Teammachine experience – the perfect stage for you to ride like a pro.",
